# Line endings in every checkout (Windows too): LF, so unix/kit, install.sh and the awk files run on Mac and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
# PowerShell files: CRLF in the working folder (stored with LF, as they always were); the UTF-8 BOM is kept.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# kit.cmd is stored with CRLF and must stay byte for byte as it is (cmd.exe misreads labels with LF)
*.cmd -text
